// EVODISP - show the workspace [I]/[J] (M x N).  Str0 title, Str8 subtitle, Str7 key hint.
// Arrow keys page through matrices larger than the screen. Any other key (or an arrow
// that cannot scroll further) ends the display and is returned in K.
// Clobbers: A B C D I J K P Q Str9
1→C
For(I,1,M)
For(J,1,N)
[I](I,J)→P:[J](I,J)→Q:prgmEVOFMT
max(C,length(Str9)+1)→C
End
End
min(C,30)→C
int(30/C)→D
0→A:0→B:0→K
Repeat K
ClrHome
Output(1,1,Str0)
Output(2,1,Str8)
For(I,A+1,min(M,A+7))
For(J,B+1,min(N,B+D))
[I](I,J)→P:[J](I,J)→Q:prgmEVOFMT
If length(Str9)≥C:sub(Str9,1,C-1)→Str9
Output(I-A+2,(J-B)C-length(Str9)+1,Str9)
End
End
If M>7 or N>D:Output(1,27,"MORE")
If V:Then
Output(10,1,"APPROX "+Str7)
Else
Output(10,1,Str7)
End
Repeat K
getKey→K
End
If K=24 and B>0:Then
max(0,B-D)→B:0→K
End
If K=26 and B+D<N:Then
B+D→B:0→K
End
If K=25 and A>0:Then
max(0,A-7)→A:0→K
End
If K=34 and A+7<M:Then
A+7→A:0→K
End
End
